            "text": "### 1️⃣ Le Procédé Mond (pour le Nickel)",
            "start": 753,
            "end": 793
          },
          {
            "id": "p10",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "**Étape 1 - Formation du composé volatil :**",
            "start": 795,
            "end": 839
          },
          {
            "id": "p11",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "$$Ni + 4CO \\xrightarrow{330K} Ni(CO)_4$$",
            "start": 840,
            "end": 880
          },
          {
            "id": "p12",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Le nickel impur réagit avec le monoxyde de carbone (CO) à 330 K pour former le **tétracarbonylnickel**, un composé gazeux.",
            "start": 882,
            "end": 1004
          },
          {
            "id": "p13",
            "category": "ORGANIZATION",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "structural"
            },
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "**Étape 2 - Décomposition (purification) :**",
            "start": 1006,
            "end": 1050
          },
          {
            "id": "p14",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "equation"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "$$Ni(CO)_4 \\xrightarrow{450-470K} Ni + 4CO$$",
            "start": 1051,
            "end": 1095
          },
          {
            "id": "p15",
            "category": "EXAMPLE",
            "attributes": {},
            "formats": [
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "Ce gaz est ensuite chauffé à une température plus élevée (450-470 K), ce qui le décompose et libère le **nickel pur**. Le CO libéré peut être réutilisé !",
            "start": 1097,
            "end": 1250
          }
        ],
        "accuracy": {
          "verdict": "accurate",
          "reason": "The reaction equations, stoichiometry, temperatures (330 K for tetracarbonylnickel formation, 450-470 K for decomposition), and chemical descriptions are fully accurate.",
          "errors": []
        }
      },
